      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "On agreeing to the resolution Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 243 - 173, 3 Present (Roll no. 165). (text: CR H3428)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "Passed/agreed to in House: On agreeing to the resolution Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 243 - 173, 3 Present (Roll no. 165). (text: CR H3428)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H3436)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.Con.Res 96, the Chair put the question on agreeing to the resolution and by voice vote, announced the ayes had prevailed. Mr. Raskin demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H. Con. Res. 96.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 5625, H.R. 6260, H.R. 8365, H. Con. Res. 96 and H.R. 8469. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 5625, H.R. 6260, H.R. 8365, and H.Con.Res. 96 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 8469 under a structured rule. The resolution makes in order one motion to recommit on each bill.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 1275. (consideration: CR H3428-3434)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-12",
        "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1275 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 5625, H.R. 6260, H.R. 8365, H. Con. Res. 96 and H.R. 8469. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 5625, H.R. 6260, H.R. 8365, and H.Con.Res. 96 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 8469 under a structured rule. The resolution makes in order one motion to recommit on each bill.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-07",
        "text": "Referred to the House Committee on the Judiciary.",
        "type": "IntroReferral"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-07",
        "text": "Submitted in House",
